        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>&lt;i&gt;Forsythia koreana&lt;/i&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>개나리는 낙엽활엽관목이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>&lt;i&gt;Ligustrum obtusifolium&lt;/i&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>쥐똥나무는 낙엽활엽관목이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>&lt;i&gt;Osmanthus fragrans&lt;/i&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>목서는 상록활엽수이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
